,\\\"artifactType\\\":0,\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Implementation plan for disabling Claude auto-failover in herdrControlGui (strictly engaging killswitch) and resolving Throne TUN conflict in vless2socks so system VPN and local proxy can operate concurrently without false-positive leak kills.\\\",\\\"version\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"requestFeedback\\\":true,\\\"userFacing\\\":true,\\\"updatedAt\\\":{\\\"$typeName\\\":\\\"google.protobuf.Timestamp\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":\\\"1790193835\\\",\\\"nanos\\\":276975100}}},\\\"file:///c%3A/Users/f/.gemini/antigravity/brain/a350a35b-a32b-4884-bbbc-79a1aa7ff643/walkthrough.md\\\":{\\\"comments\\\":[],\\\"artifactMetadata\\\":{\\\"$typeName\\\":\\\"exa.codeium_common_pb.ArtifactMetadata\\\",\\\"artifactType\\\":0,\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Отчет о реализации быстрого опроса портов (2.0 с), мгновенного восстановления Claude Killswitch, подробного анализа нагрузки на CPU, прохождения всех 61 тестов, сборки релиза HerdrControlCenter.exe и пуша в GitHub.\\\",\\\"version\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"requestFeedback\\\":false,\\\"userFacing\\\":true,\\\"updatedAt\\\":{\\\"$typeName\\\":\\\"google.protobuf.Timestamp\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":\\\"1790201469\\\",\\\"nanos\\\":544943900}}},\\\"file:///c%3A/Users/f/.gemini/antigravity/brain/a350a35b-a32b-4884-bbbc-79a1aa7ff643/README.md\\\":{\\\"comments\\\":[],\\\"artifactMetadata\\\":{\\\"$typeName\\\":\\\"exa.codeium_common_pb.ArtifactMetadata\\\",\\\"artifactType\\\":0,\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Fully corrected bilingual README.md for Herdr Control Center with exact repository URLs, Localization tab documentation, and architecture diagrams.\\\",\\\"version\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"requestFeedback\\\":false,\\\"userFacing\\\":true,\\\"updatedAt\\\":{\\\"$typeName\\\":\\\"google.protobuf.Timestamp\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":\\\"1790034823\\\",\\\"nanos\\\":172839600}}},\\\"file:///c%3A/Users/f/.gemini/antigravity/brain/a350a35b-a32b-4884-bbbc-79a1aa7ff643/ARCHITECTURE.md\\\":{\\\"comments\\\":[],\\\"artifactMetadata\\\":{\\\"$typeName\\\":\\\"exa