INSERT INTO "messages" VALUES('c0f6a939','96eb91fc','c0f6a939','thinking','{"content":"**Decoding Error Explored**\n\nOkay, so I''ve delved deeper into that `UnicodeDecodeError` in the log. It appears this console issue extends beyond the initial problem, now affecting both adding a Claude account *and* adding a Gemini account. It''s becoming increasingly clear that this is a critical underlying issue.\n\n\n**Fixing Console Launch**\n\nI''ve pinpointed the root cause! `cmd.exe /c start` is butchering nested quotes within `bash_cmd`, leading to terminal errors. Switching to `wsl.exe` with `CREATE_NEW_CONSOLE` bypasses `cmd` completely, ensuring clean argument passing and reliable console launches. This should resolve the \"window not opening/crashing on startup\" issue.\n\n\n","status":"done","duration_ms":1064}','left','finish',0,1790227428237,NULL);
