profile=profile_name, total=total),\n                initialvalue=curr, minvalue=1, maxvalue=max(total, 1), parent=self\n            )\n\nSTDERR:"}','left','finish',0,1790228080383,NULL);
INSERT INTO "messages" VALUES('c055d0ee','96eb91fc','c055d0ee','thinking','{"content":"**Analyzing Account Logic**\n\nI''ve pinpointed the key conditional statement: `if not is_active and len(self.gemini_profiles) > 1:`. This is the crux of the account deletion prevention logic. I believe I understand what''s missing, for Gemini!\nI think I can leverage this as a basis to provide a solution!\nFor Gemini: \"нельзя удалить аккаунт, который не прошел авторизация, сделай так чтобы работала корзина была иконка и она удаляла\"\n\n\n","status":"done","duration_ms":5}','left','finish',0,1790228086637,NULL);
