as_locked and password:\n            lock_tokens(password)\n\ndef ensure_locked():\n    \"\"\"Следит за тем, чтобы 99% времени токены оставались зашифрованными.\"\"\"\n    pw = backup_manager.get_env_password()\n    if pw and not is_vault_locked():\n        lock_tokens(pw)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":"},"output":"You must Read /mnt/d/My files/herdrControlGui/token_vault_manager.py before editing. Use the Read tool first so the file content is loaded into context."}','left','error',0,1790230518628,NULL);
