INSERT INTO "messages" VALUES('6269095c','1b86bd77','6269095c','thinking','{"content":"**Clarifying User Intent**\n\nI''ve hit a slight snag, realizing I might have misinterpreted the user''s intent. It seems they''re asking if I can prompt Claude and if I can see another chat. Thinking, if they''re using AionUi, perhaps a CLI tool or a clarification is needed.\n\n\n**Exploring Interaction Options**\n\nI am now focusing on the interaction possibilities. It''s clear I can''t directly \"see\" another chat, being isolated to the current one. The question is how to interact with Claude. I''m considering using `Spawn` to make a sub-agent. I looked at available tools, like `skill-creator` and others, but none directly handle \"asking Claude.\" I need to find if I can read chat history files.\n\n\n","status":"done","duration_ms":396}','left','finish',0,1790248613899,NULL);
